    "content": "<h2>Dating</h2>\n<h2>dating for</h2>\n<p>singles, online dating, the art of dating, dating workshops, building confidence on dates, how to date, guide to</p>\n<h2>dating,</h2>\n<p>Dating?</p>\n<h2>Wondering why you never seem to</h2>\n<p>make a go at a long-term relationship or the dating pool resembles a parched wasteland with no viable thirst quenchers in sight?</p>\n<h2>Doesn't matter how smart you are</h2>\n<p>Single's make some pretty incredible mistakes navigating the sea of love!</p>\n<h2>Top ten</h2>\n<p>most incredible mistakes smart single's make when dating that often kill the relationship before it has the opportunity to get off the ground. Are you guilty of any? Find out!</p>\n<h2>Singles keep looking for</h2>\n<p>someone to make them happy when it’s their job to make himself/herself happy.</p>\n<h2>Singles fail to build a life</h2>\n<p>they really enjoy because they never take the time to learn what is meaningful and fulfilling to them, and what brings them joy.</p>\n<h2>Singles stay in relationships</h2>\n<p>that aren’t working because: – They don’t want to be alone, – They keep hoping they can make it better</p>\n<h2>Singles push love away because</h2>\n<p>they aren’t emotionally prepared for a relationship. They have too much &quot;baggage&quot; from the past; they never grow up.</p>\n<h2>Singles rely on destiny and</h2>\n<p>luck instead of working on themselves and pursing a relationship.</p>\n<p>Singles don’t learn from their mistakes.</p>\n<h2>Singles keep procrastinating</h2>\n<p>about their personal lives, they don’t go out enough.</p>\n<h2>Singles never decide or become</h2>\n<p>aware of what they really want and need in a long-term relationship. So their decisions are based on superficial criteria.</p>\n<h2>Singles often spend a lifetime</h2>\n<p>looking for perfection instead of building a good relationship with another normal person.</p>\n<p>Singles get stuck. They don’t &quot;move-on,&quot; they try and protect themselves emotionally instead of taking reasonable risks.</p>\n<p>.. so life never changes.</p>\n<h2>Other</h2>\n<h2>dating tips, advice &amp; articles</h2>\n<h2>Choosing the right dating</h2>\n<p>method</p>\n<h2>Going out on a date</h2>\n<h2>What to take on a date</h2>\n<h2>Dating Jokes</h2>\n<h2>Dating Safely</h2>"
