    "content": "<h2>Dating Resources::: Books</h2>\n<h2>books, books on</h2>\n<p>informative dating, new to dating, improve your dating abilities, dating safely, safe date, date safe, cautious dating, common sense dating, slow dating, online to date, guide to dating,</p>\n<h2>Don't</h2>\n<p>leave anything to chance - pick the brains of the experts and learn to be a dating pro...</p>\n<p>http://www.dateschool.com.au/aus_killerwomen.html (http://www.dateschool.com.au/aus_killerwomen.html)</p>\n<h2>Creating a Killer Profile</h2>\n<p>(For Women)</p>\n<h2>Jodi Hooper</h2>\n<p>See the difference a great profile can make to both the amount and type of men you attract. It's not just what you say... It's how you say it, when you say it and what you leave unsaid.</p>\n<p>Read More (http://www.dateschool.com.au/aus_killerwomen.html)</p>\n<p>http://www.dateschool.com.au/aus_killermen.html (http://www.dateschool.com.au/aus_killermen.html)</p>\n<h2>Creating</h2>\n<p>a Killer Profile (For Men)</p>\n<p>type of women you attract. It's not just what you say... It's how you say it, when you say it and what you leave unsaid.</p>\n<p>Read More (http://www.dateschool.com.au/aus_killermen.html)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0809224356/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0809224356/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<h2>How To Be A People Magnet</h2>\n<h2>Leil Lowndes</h2>\n<p>Proven ways to polish your people skills.</p>\n<p>Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0809224356/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/1903399432/internatiosmi-21 (http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/1903399432/internatiosmi-21)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/007141858X/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/007141858X/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>How</p>\n<h2>To Talk To Anyone</h2>\n<p>Charming body language, secrets of empathy and how to be an insider Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/007141858X/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0007108435/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0007108435/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<h2>Flirt Coach</h2>\n<h2>Peta Heskell</h2>\n<p>Make every relationship more fun with the power of flirting Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0007108435/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0966972309/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0966972309/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<h2>Man's Guide To Dating</h2>\n<p>Robert A. Wray A great read for both sexes in understanding men and womens' dating expectations and behaviour Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0966972309/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1861055021/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1861055021/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<h2>The Dating Survival Guide</h2>\n<h2>Dr Pam Spurr</h2>\n<p>The ultimate guide to negotiating your way around the minefield of the dating game.</p>\n<p>Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1861055021/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0452280117/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0452280117/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<h2>Guerilla</h2>\n<h2>Dating Tactics</h2>\n<h2>Sharyn Wolf</h2>\n<p>A fun guide to winning the dating game. A must read Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0452280117/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1569750602/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1569750602/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<h2>Secrets of Sexual Body Language</h2>\n<h2>Martin Lloyd-Elliot</h2>\n<p>Between a man and a woman, what's unspoken matters most..</p>\n<p>Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1569750602/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0961317744/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0961317744/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<h2>Sexpectations</h2>\n<h2>R Louis</h2>\n<h2>Women talk candidly about sex and dating</h2>\n<p>Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0961317744/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0809229897/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0809229897/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>How To make Anyone Fall In Love With You: 85 Proven Techniques Advice on your first date, how to get sexy &quot;bedroom eyes&quot; and how to drive your partner wild in bed...</p>\n<p>Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0809229897/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0399527397/internatiosmi-20 (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0399527397/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<p>The</p>\n<h2>6 Secrets of a Lasting Relationship</h2>\n<h2>Mark Goulston</h2>\n<p>How to fall in love again and stay there Read More (http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0399527397/internatiosmi-20)</p>\n<h2>Resources::: Dating Sites</h2>\n<p>http://www.dateschool.com.au/ausingle_profdoc.html (http://www.dateschool.com.au/ausingle_profdoc.html)</p>\n<p>http://tracker.netklix.com/v4/click.asp?frmNKLinkId=192722 (http://tracker.netklix.com/v4/click.asp?frmNKLinkId=192722)</p>"
